# Reference only: shell variables, not automatically loaded.
# Optional isolated application data location:
# JARVIS_USER_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/local/app-data
# Optional development/test model directory (no secrets):
# JARVIS_VOICE_MODELS_DIR=/absolute/path/to/verified/voice-models
# Phase 3 optional cloud AI: supply OPENAI_API_KEY securely in the environment
# or save it using AI connections in the app. Never paste a key into source.
# Optional development override to an existing Python 3.12 environment:
# JARVIS_PYTHON=/absolute/path/to/python3.12
